<title>USA: Global Maintech Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Global Maintech Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter Ended September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>						  1996		 1995</p>
<p> Revenue				  $801,817	    $181,947</p>
<p> Net					 313,988	   (280,433)</p>
<p> Net Per Share(a)			  0.021	     (0.028)</p>
<p>Nine Months Ended September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>						 1996		  1995</p>
<p> Revenue				 2,006,091	     613,647</p>
<p> Net					 627,971	   (280,732)</p>
<p> Net Per Share(a)			  0.044	     (0.033)</p>
<p>(Figures in thousands except for earnings per share.)</p>
<p>Figures in parentheses are negative. (a) Earnings per share figures have been restated for reverse stock split of one-for-five effective November 12, 1996.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
